{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124063","id":4704498770,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGGj0Ug","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124063","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124063.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124063.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124063","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124063/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124063/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124063/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a054bcb9d68891886aba443a32fcfcf85dc0b726","number":124063,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"xatlas: Add <stdlib.h> include to fix build with newer macOS SDKs","user":{"login":"jfulponi","id":61839284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODM5Mjg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61839284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi","html_url":"https://github.com/jfulponi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"xatlas.cpp uses `realloc`/`free` when initializing its allocation function pointers (`s_realloc`/`s_free`), but relied on those symbols being pulled in transitively by another header. Newer macOS SDKs no longer expose `realloc`/`free` through such transitive includes, breaking the build with:\n\n```\nthirdparty/xatlas/xatlas.cpp:166:32: error: use of undeclared identifier 'realloc'; did you mean 's_realloc'?\n```\n\nThis adds the explicit `<stdlib.h>` include and documents it as a patch file under `thirdparty/xatlas/patches/` plus a `Patches:` section in `thirdparty/README.md`, per thirdparty conventions.\n\nBug confirmed and fix verified by a successful `scons` build once the include is added.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T13:45:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T13:55:27Z","closed_at":"2026-10-01T13:50:12Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f9ec8e9d3e09fbda6862014cdcb260502bf63004","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jfulponi:xatlas-stdlib-include","ref":"xatlas-stdlib-include","repo":{"id":1400014645,"node_id":"R_kgDOU3KHNQ","name":"godot","full_name":"jfulponi/godot","owner":{"login":"jfulponi","id":61839284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODM5Mjg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61839284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi","html_url":"https://github.com/jfulponi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap